://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_1102_9_firsfioejfsiojfeisfjofroj.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_1102_10_fjsifekokfeopkfeoskofesk.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間外ろうどうなら毎日でもやりたいものです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもかわいい猫のしゃしんもあるので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シェア～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_1102_11_jspkfeokfesokfeospksfeosfe.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_1102_12_fsofekofeksokfesokosfep.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_1102_13_fsjiefoseopefskopkespokkoes.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっそうなかよしになれたのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_1102_14_skoefkoksepofeksseoksofeksp.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカにやさしくしてるのはもちろんのこと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかり自分がえらんだ道をつきすすんで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どりょくしつづけるおたけは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にすてきなのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカのおでこのしわの相談にものってくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげさまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなツルツルになりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_1102_15_fsifeofkesopkfesopkesf.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカもこのコンディションをいじできるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どりょくしていくつもり～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_1102_frisjfifjeijfiesjioesfjiefsjiesjeso.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あらためて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おたけ　たんじょう日おめでと～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ってか」の店頭あいさつが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんしゅうもまだまだ続くみたいなので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカもフルかどうで、がんばるです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカ"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-59542":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。上村ひなのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はなんだかまだ「6回目のひな誕祭」の余韻に浸っていたくて\nひとりで横浜に行ってぶらり、お散歩してきました！！\n勝手にひな誕祭DAY.3を開催しちゃおうと思いまして。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobPwVYRr.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おひさまの皆さんがよくレターとかで送ってくださる「ハマスタだよ！」ってやつをやってみたかったんだけどどうかなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手くできてる、？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アクスタでいつでもどこでも一緒だよ☺️🤍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば歩いてたら球場のところのショップでスターマンのパネルを見かけました！\nスターマンとキララちゃんもライブにご出演いただきありがとうございました！\n可愛くってずっとずっと大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobJq7GsI.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花が綺麗に咲いてたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobiwuf4i.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「6回目のひな誕祭」でポカまんを販売してくださっていた、江戸清さんの横濱豚包を食べました！美味しかったです🤤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、生まれて初めて鳩さんが頭上をかすめて去っていきました。\nなんなら一瞬頭に乗っちゃって、焦った。\n信じられないほど一瞬の出来事でした…\nあ、久美さんの卒セレグッズのキャップを被っていたので私の頭は無事だよ！(くみさんありがとうございます)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobKxkm7G.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにバッグは久美さんの卒セレグッズのトートバッグ\n寒くて脱げなかったけどコートの中にはみーぱんさんの卒セレグッズのスウェット着てきました🥟🍞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「横浜ワールドポーターズ×日向坂で会いましょう」の展示も観に行ってきました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mob9WbjX0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な展示をありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobv5MahE.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スナック久美、初来店👏"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mob1S1Gi6.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobXC6pkD.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お散歩楽しかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ行きたいところは沢山でしたが残り時間が少なく、今回のお散歩はここまでとなってしまいました、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また横浜、そしてハマスタに来られますように〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"📖上村ひなのの書籍「へんてこスイッチ」いよいよ明日発売です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、発売日当日の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月9日（水）21:15～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「へんてこスイッチ」発売記念SHOWROOM 配信が決定しました🎉🎉\nやったー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"配信中にSHOPROOMから書籍を購入いただきますと、なんとなんと今回のSHOWROOM配信限定絵柄の「昭和レトロ私服衣装ポストカード」がついてきます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobfqjURO.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな文化、昭和レトロな雰囲気は絶対に書籍に取り入れたくて、私服カットで素敵なお洋服を着ることにしました👗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りなのでよかったらゲットしてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで沢山お喋りしたいなぁ\n楽しい配信にできたらと思いますー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://www.showroom-live.com/r/46_HINANO_KAMIMURA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑上村ひなのルームはこちらから！\n明日21:15〜是非遊びにきてくださいねっ☺️🤍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://www.hinatazaka46.com/s/official/news/detail/M02379"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑へんてこスイッチのご予約、詳細はこちら📖"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobYHabHa.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この表紙が目印です。\nよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを書いているいま、速報が入りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"📢本日より五期生のリレーブログがスタートするみたい！！\n楽しみだよー！！\nみんなのこともっともっと知りたいので私も熟読しようと思います！！\nおひさまの皆さんも是非☀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}